eneck(s). For each, classify as:\\n- **memory**: Memory bandwidth is the limiting factor\\n- **compute**: Compute throughput is the limiting factor\\n- **underutilized**: Neither saturated (<60% both), indicating stalls/occupancy issues\\n\\n## GPU Specifications\\n- Name: AMD Instinct MI300X\\n- Architecture: CDNA3 (gfx942)\\n- Peak Memory Bandwidth: 5.3e+03 GB/s\\n- Peak FP32 Performance: 163 TFLOPS\\n- Peak FP16 Performance: 1.3e+03 TFLOPS\\n- SM Count: 304\\n- Max Threads per SM: 2048\\n- L1 Cache per SM: 32 KB\\n- L2 Cache (Total): 4 MB\\n- Memory Size: 192 GB HBM3\\n\\n## Roofline Analysis\\n- Bottleneck: compute\\n- Compute SOL: 90.7%\\n- Memory SOL: 22.5%\\n- Efficiency: 90.7%\\n- Headroom: 9.3%\\n- At Roofline: No\\n- Tensor Cores: No\\n- Warnings: None\\n\\n## NCU Metrics\\n### Other Metrics\\n  - _fused_causal_attention_mfma: {'sm__throughput.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed': 90.74082643098423, 'gpu__compute_memory_throughput.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed': 22.471627677012407, 'sm__pipe_tensor_cycles_active.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_active': 0.0, 'sm__cycles_active.avg': 6324504.0, 'sm__warps_active.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_active': 100.0, 'sm__inst_executed.sum': 88518656.0, 'sm__inst_executed_pipe_tensor.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_active': 0.0, 'launch__registers_per_thread': 84.0, 'launch__shared_mem_per_block_allocated': 32768.0, 'dram__throughput.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed': 22.471627677012407, 'gpu__dram_throughput.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsed': 22.471627677012407, 'dram__bytes_read.sum': 231724505.0, 'dram__bytes_write.sum': 65853150.0, 'dram__bytes.sum.per_second': 778249369717.1311, 'rocm__dispatch_duration_ns': 382368.0, 'rocm__issue_util_pct': 100.0, 'rocm__compute_mix_pct': 90.74082643098423, 'rocm__vmem_mix_pct': 0.0, 'rocm__tcc_util_pct': 22.471627677012407, 'rocm__active_inst_total': 88518656.0, 'rocm__Dispatch_ID': 4.0, 'rocm__Grid_Size': 262144.0, 'rocm__Workgroup_Size': 256.0, 'rocm__LDS_Per_Workgroup': 32768.0, 'rocm__